        <h1>Med Spa Lead Generation: From Inquiry to Consultation</h1>
        <p class="lf-lede">Med spa lead generation means attracting people interested in a practice&#x27;s services, capturing appropriate inquiries and helping suitable prospects schedule consultations. Acquisition and follow-up should function as one connected system.</p>
